o the right of the person whose birthday is in February.\n\n\nsolution_header = [\'House\', \'Name\', \'Birthday\']\n\nattribute_values = {\'Name\': [\'Alice\', \'Arnold\', \'Eric\', \'Peter\', \'Bob\', \'Carol\'], \'Birthday\': [\'sept\', \'mar\', \'feb\', \'jan\', \'may\', \'april\']}\n\nSolve the puzzle above and provide n_houses, attribute_values, parsed_clues, reasoning, and solution for this puzzle in the <answer> </answer> block, with no additional text.assistant\n\n']
