e, the short house must be in the first house.", "S9: short == 1.", "Clue 12 tells us there are two houses between the very tall house and Eric, so the very tall house must be in the fourth house.", "S10: very_tall == 4.", "Clue 2 then tells us there's one house between Bob and the very tall person, so Bob must be in the fifth house.", "S11: Bob == 5.", "Clue 1 then tells us Carol isn't in the sixth house, so she must be in one of the remaining houses, and since the very tall house is in the fourth house, Carol must be in the sixth house.", "S12: Carol == 6.", "Clue 11 tells us Carol isn't in the second house, so she must be in the sixth house.", "S13: Carol == 6.", "With all the pieces together, we can start to see the solution take shape."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "very_short"], ["2", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Bob", "super_tall"], ["5", "Carol", "short"], ["6", "Peter", "average"]]}}
