ouse.", "S10: Carol == 6.", "Clue 9 tells us Peter is not in the sixth house, so he must be in the first house.", "S11: Peter == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, we can start to piece together the solution."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "super_tall"], ["2", "Bob", "very_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Carol", "average"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
