ight of the very tall person, so the very short person must be in the fifth house.", "S11: very_short > super_tall.", "With all clues satisfied, we can start to piece together the solution."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "super_tall"], ["2", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["3", "Carol", "average"], ["4", "Arnold", "very_tall"], ["5", "Bob", "very_short"], ["6", "Alice", "tall"]]}}
