he very tall house.", "S9: very_tall == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, we can start to piece together the solution."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "very_tall"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["4", "Carol", "short"], ["5", "Alice", "average"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
