 fifth house.", "S9: Carol == 5.", "Clue 6 confirms the short person is in the fourth house, and Clue 8 confirms the short person is directly left of Eric, so the short person must be in the third house.", "S10: short == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "super_tall"], ["2", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["3", "Carol", "tall"], ["4", "Alice", "short"], ["5", "Arnold", "very_short"], ["6", "Peter", "average"]]}}
