ouse.", "S9: Carol == 5.", "Clue 2 confirms there is one house between Bob and the very tall person, so Bob must be in the first house and the very tall person must be in the fourth house.", "S10: very_tall == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["5", "Arnold", "short"], ["6", "Peter", "very_short"]]}}
