st be in the sixth house.", "S9: Eric == 6.", "Clue 2 tells us there is one house between Bob and the very tall person, and since Bob is in the third house, the very tall person must be in the fifth house.", "S10: very_tall == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Carol", "tall"], ["3", "Bob", "super_tall"], ["4", "Alice", "short"], ["5", "Arnold", "very_tall"], ["6", "Eric", "very_tall"]]}}
