d house.", "S9: Carol == 3.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, so the very tall person must be in the fifth house.", "S10: very_tall == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Carol", "average"], ["2", "Peter", "short"], ["3", "Bob", "tall"], ["4", "Arnold", "very_short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Alice", "super_tall"]]}}
