ll person is in the fifth house, Eric must be in the sixth house.", "S9: Eric == 6.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, so Carol must be in the second house.", "S10: Carol == 2.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Arnold", "short"], ["5", "Peter", "very_short"], ["6", "Eric", "very_tall"]]}}
