se, Eric must be in the sixth house.", "S9: Eric == 6.", "Clue 2 tells us there is one house between Bob and the very tall person, and since Bob is in the first house and the very tall person is in the fifth house, the very tall person must be in the third house.", "S10: very_tall == 3.", "Clue 6 confirms the short person is in the fourth house, and since the short person is directly left of Eric, Eric must be in the fifth house.", "S11: Eric == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["5", "Arnold", "short"], ["6", "Peter", "very_short"]]}}
