cond house.", "S9: Bob + 3 == Eric.", "Clue 6 confirms the short person is not in the first house, and since the short person is in the fourth house, the average person must be in the first house.", "S10: average == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Alice", "short"], ["4", "Carol", "very_short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "super_tall"]]}}
