.", "Clue 12 confirms that there are two houses between the super tall person and Eric, and since the super tall person is in the third house, Bob must be in the first house.", "S10: Bob == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Alice", "tall"], ["3", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["4", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["5", "Arnold", "short"], ["6", "Peter", "very_short"]]}}
