on.", "S10: Carol == short.", "Clue 9 confirms the very short person is to the right of the very tall person, so the very short person must be in house 6.", "S11: very_short == 6.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Carol", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "super_tall"], ["3", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["4", "Alice", "short"], ["5", "Arnold", "tall"], ["6", "Peter", "very_short"]]}}
