he fifth house.", "S10: Alice == 5.", "Clue 5 confirms the January birthday is next to the March birthday, but since the March birthday is in the third house, the January birthday must be the Eric.", "S11: Eric == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Bob", "mar"], ["3", "Alice", "feb"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Eric", "may"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
