be in the fifth house.", "S11: feb == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "may"], ["2", "Eric", "jan"], ["3", "Peter", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Bob", "april"]]}}
