fth house.", "S12: Alice == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Bob", "sept"], ["3", "Alice", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "feb"], ["5", "Peter", "may"], ["6", "Eric", "jan"]]}}
