ol == 5.", "Clue 6 confirms Carol is in house 5, and since Bob is in house 1, Alice must be in house 3.", "S11: Alice == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Arnold", "short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Peter", "very_short"]]}}
