s to the right of the February birthday, so the May birthday must be in the sixth house.", "S11: may == 6.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is next to the September birthday, and since the September birthday is in the fourth house, the March birthday must be in the third house.", "S12: mar == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Bob", "mar"], ["3", "Eric", "feb"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "may"], ["6", "Peter", "jan"]]}}
