.", "Clue 9 confirms Bob is not in the fifth house, and since Alice is in the fifth house, Bob must be in the sixth house.", "S11: Bob == 6.", "Clue 5 confirms the May birthday is next to the April birthday, and since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the May birthday must be the Bob.", "S12: may == Bob.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Peter", "mar"], ["3", "Bob", "feb"], ["4", "Eric", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "may"], ["6", "Carol", "jan"]]}}
