 one house between Carol and Alice, and since Alice is in the fifth house, the Carol must be in the fourth house.", "S11: Carol == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "april"], ["3", "Bob", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Peter", "may"]]}}
