ice must be in house 5.", "S10: Alice == 5.", "Clue 11 tells us there are two houses between the super tall person and Eric, and since Eric is in house 3, the super tall person must be in house 1.", "S11: super_tall == 1.", "Clue 12 tells us there are two houses between the super tall person and Eric, and since Eric is in house 3, Carol must be in house 4.", "S12: Carol == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "short"], ["2", "Bob", "average"], ["3", "Carol", "tall"], ["4", "Arnold", "super_tall"], ["5", "Alice", "very_short"], ["6", "Eric", "very_tall"]]}}
