 must be in house 5.", "S10: Peter == 5.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since Peter is in house 5, Carol must be in house 3.", "S11: Carol == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "super_tall"], ["2", "Bob", "short"], ["3", "Carol", "average"], ["4", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["5", "Peter", "short"], ["6", "Alice", "tall"]]}}
