ust be in house 5.", "S10: Eric == 5.", "Clue 5 tells us Peter is not in the sixth house, so Peter must be in house 1.", "S11: Peter == 1.", "Clue 6 confirms Carol is not in the second house, so Carol must be in house 5.", "S12: Carol == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "short"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Carol", "very_short"], ["5", "Arnold", "super_tall"], ["6", "Eric", "very_tall"]]}}
