se.", "S11: may == 6.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Peter is the Arnold, Peter must be the January birthday.", "S12: jan == Peter.", "Clue 4 confirms the April birthday is in the second house, and since Bob is in the third house, the April birthday must be the Bob.", "S13: april == Bob.", "Clue 5 confirms the January birthday is the Eric, and since Eric is in the fifth house, the Eric must be the February birthday.", "S14: Eric == feb.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Peter", "may"], ["3", "Bob", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Eric", "jan"]]}}
