t be in the sixth house.", "S13: may == 6.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, so Arnold must be the Peter.", "S14: Peter == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Peter", "may"], ["3", "Bob", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Eric", "jan"]]}}
