uper_tall == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since Carol is in house 5, Peter must be in house 1.", "S11: Peter == 1.", "Clue 6 confirms the short person is in house 4, and since short is not in the first house, Peter must be the short person.", "S12: Peter == short.", "Clue 9 confirms the short person is to the left of Eric, and since Eric is in house 5, Bob must be in house 3.", "S13: Bob == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["4", "Alice", "short"], ["5", "Arnold", "very_tall"], ["6", "Eric", "very_short"]]}}
