 April birthday is to the left of the May birthday, so the April birthday must be in the first house.", "S12: april == 1.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since April is in the first house, Arnold must be the April birthday.", "S13: Arnold == april.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Bob", "may"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
