lue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, so Carol must be in house 5.", "S11: Carol == 5.", "Clue 2 tells us Bob is one house away from the very tall person, and since Eric is in the very tall position, Bob must be in house 1.", "S12: Bob == 1.", "Clue 9 confirms the short person is not in the third house, so the short person must be in house 2.", "S13: short == 2.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "short"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["5", "Arnold", "very_tall"], ["6", "Eric", "very_short"]]}}
