ay birthday is in the sixth house, the May birthday must be the Carol.", "S11: may == Carol.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Arnold is the Eric, the solution is clear.", "S12: Eric == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Bob", "may"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
