uary birthday, and since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the May birthday must be the Carol.", "S11: may == Carol.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Arnold is the Eric, Peter must be in the second house.", "S12: Peter == 2.", "Clue 9 confirms Bob is not in the fifth house, so Bob must be in the sixth house.", "S13: Bob == 6.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Peter is in the second house, Alice must be in the third house.", "S14: Alice == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Peter", "may"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Bob", "april"]]}}
