ry birthday, and since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the February birthday must be in the fifth house.", "S11: feb == 5.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Alice is in the fifth house, Peter must be in the sixth house.", "S12: Peter == 6.", "Clue 5 confirms the April birthday is to the left of the May birthday, and since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the April birthday must be in the third house.", "S13: april == 3.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Peter is in the sixth house, Bob must be in the second house.", "S14: Bob == 2.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Bob", "mar"], ["3", "Peter", "april"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Eric", "may"]]}}
