.", "S11: Arnold == jan.", "Clue 4 confirms Carol is the September birthday, and since the September birthday is in house 4, Carol must be in house 4.", "S12: Carol == 4.", "Clue 5 confirms the May birthday is to the right of the February birthday, and since the May birthday is in house 6, the May birthday must be the April birthday.", "S13: april == 6.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Carol", "sept"], ["4", "Bob", "may"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
