e, the May birthday must be the Bob.", "S11: may == Bob.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Arnold is the March birthday, Peter must be in the second house.", "S12: Peter == 2.", "Clue 4 confirms Carol is the September birthday, and since Carol is in the fourth house, the April birthday must be in the first house.", "S13: april == 1.", "Clue 5 confirms the January birthday is Eric, and since Eric is in the fifth house, the February birthday must be in the fourth house.", "S14: feb == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "mar"], ["2", "Peter", "april"], ["3", "Alice", "may"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Eric", "feb"], ["6", "Bob", "jan"]]}}
