: feb == 4.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Alice is in the fifth house, Peter must be in the third house.", "S11: Peter == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is next to the September birthday, and since the March birthday is in the third house, the September birthday must be in the fourth house.", "S12: sept == 3.", "Clue 1 tells us Arnold is in the first house, and since Peter is in the third house, Bob must be in the sixth house.", "S13: Bob == 6.", "Clue 9 tells us the May birthday is to the right of the February birthday, and since May is in the fifth house, the April birthday must be in the sixth house.", "S14: april == 6.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Peter", "may"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Bob", "april"]]}}
