ms the May birthday is to the right of the February birthday, and since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the February birthday must be in the fifth house.", "S11: feb == 5.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Arnold is the January birthday, Peter must be in the third house.", "S12: Peter == 3.", "Clue 4 confirms Carol is the September birthday, and since the September birthday is in the fourth house, Carol must be in the fourth house.", "S13: Carol == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Peter", "feb"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "may"], ["6", "Bob", "april"]]}}
