use 3, the second house must be occupied by Bob.", "S10: Bob == 2.", "Clue 12 tells us there are two houses between the super tall person and Eric, and since the super tall person is in house 4, Eric must be in house 5.", "S11: Eric == 5.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in house 6, Carol must be in house 3.", "S12: Carol == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in house 6, Peter must be in house 5.", "S13: Peter == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Bob", "average"], ["2", "Alice", "tall"], ["3", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["4", "Peter", "short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
