 us there is one house between Carol and Alice, and since Carol is in house 3, Alice must be in house 5.", "S12: Alice == 5.", "Clue 9 confirms Bob is not in the fifth house, so Bob must be the May birthday, which is in house 6.", "S13: Bob == may.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is next to the April birthday, and since the April birthday is in house 5, the March birthday must be in house 4.", "S14: mar == 4.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "may"], ["3", "Carol", "sept"], ["4", "Alice", "mar"], ["5", "Peter", "feb"], ["6", "Bob", "april"]]}}
