nd since Carol is in house 3, the May birthday must be in house 5.", "S12: may == 5.", "Clue 4 confirms Carol is the September birthday, and since Alice is in house 5, the April birthday must be in house 4.", "S13: april == 4.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is next to the September birthday, and since the April birthday is in house 4, the March birthday must be in house 3.", "S14: mar == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Carol", "sept"], ["4", "Alice", "feb"], ["5", "Bob", "may"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
