wo houses between the super tall person and Eric, and since the super tall person is in house 4, the super tall person must be in house 3.", "S10: super_tall == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in house 6, Peter must be in house 1.", "S11: Peter == 1.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in house 6, Carol must be in house 5.", "S12: Carol == 5.", "Clue 2 confirms there is one house between Bob and the very tall person, and since the super tall person is in house 4, Bob must be in house 2.", "S13: Bob == 2.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Arnold", "super_tall"], ["4", "Carol", "short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Alice", "very_short"]]}}
