er tall person and Eric, and since the super tall person is in house 4, Eric must be in house 5.", "S10: Eric == 5.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since Carol is in house 5, the super tall person must be in house 4.", "S11: super_tall == 4.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since Eric is in house 5, Peter must be in house 1.", "S12: Peter == 1.", "Clue 9 confirms the short person is directly left of Eric, and since Eric is in house 5, the short person must be in house 4.", "S13: short == 4.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since Peter is in house 1, Carol must be in house 5.", "S14: Carol == 5.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Alice", "short"], ["4", "Carol", "super_tall"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
