hday is next to the September birthday, but since the September birthday is in the fourth house, the March birthday must be in the third house.", "S13: mar == 3.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Eric is in the first house, Eric must be the January birthday.", "S14: Eric == jan.", "Clue 9 tells us the May birthday is to the right of the February birthday, but since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the February birthday must be in the fifth house.", "S15: feb == 5.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Eric is in the first house, Arnold must be the January birthday.", "S16: Arnold == jan.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Bob", "feb"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "may"], ["6", "Peter", "april"]]}}
