 is in the fifth house, so the February birthday must be to the left of the May birthday.", "S12: feb == 5.", "Clue 7 confirms Eric is the January birthday, so Eric must be in the first house.", "S13: Eric == 1.", "Clue 9 tells us Bob is not in the fifth house, so Bob must be in the third house.", "S14: Bob == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is to the left of the September birthday, and since the March birthday is in the third house, the May birthday must be to the right of the September birthday.", "S15: may > sept.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since the April birthday is in the first house, Arnold must be the April birthday.", "S16: Arnold == april.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "april"], ["2", "Peter", "may"], ["3", "Bob", "mar"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "feb"], ["6", "Eric", "jan"]]}}
