 2 tells us Bob is one house away from the very tall person, and since Eric is in the fifth house, Bob must be in house 3.", "S10: Bob == 3.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since Peter is in house 1, the average person must be in house 2.", "S11: average == 2.", "Clue 1 tells us Carol is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in the sixth house, Carol must be in house 5.", "S12: Carol == 5.", "Clue 9 confirms the short person is not in the third house, but since the short person is in the fourth house, the short person must be the very short person.", "S13: short == very_short.", "Clue 5 confirms Peter is not in the sixth house, and since the very short person is in the sixth house, Peter must be in house 1.", "S14: Peter == 1.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Alice", "tall"], ["3", "Bob", "super_tall"], ["4", "Carol", "short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
