b is not in the fifth house, so Bob must be in the third house.", "S12: Bob == 3.", "Clue 9 confirms the April birthday is to the left of the May birthday, but since the May birthday is in the sixth house, the April birthday must be in the fifth house.", "S13: april == 5.", "Clue 1 confirms Arnold is in the first house, and since Eric is in the first house, Eric must be the January birthday.", "S14: Eric == jan.", "Clue 5 confirms the March birthday is next to the September birthday, but since the September birthday is in the fourth house, the March birthday must be in the third house.", "S15: mar == 3.", "With all clues satisfied, the solution is clear."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Birthday"], "rows": [["1", "Arnold", "jan"], ["2", "Eric", "mar"], ["3", "Bob", "feb"], ["4", "Carol", "sept"], ["5", "Alice", "april"], ["6", "Peter", "may"]]}}
